    materi pihak ketiga mengikuti lisensi yang tercantum di masing-masing tulisan.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Ketepatan dan koreksi</h2>
  <p>
    Kami berusaha menyajikan informasi yang akurat dan mencantumkan sumbernya. Kalau ada kesalahan, kami meralatnya secara
    terbuka. Konten kami bersifat informasi umum, bukan nasihat profesional.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Perubahan dan kontak</h2>
  <p>
    Ketentuan ini dapat diperbarui sewaktu-waktu, dengan tanggal pembaruan tercantum di atas. Ketentuan ini tunduk pada
    hukum Republik Indonesia. Pertanyaan: <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
  </p>

  <hr />
  <h2 lang="en">Terms of Service (English)</h2>
  <div lang="en">
    <p>
      These terms cover abece's websites (abece.my.id, anekdot.id) and our internal publishing tool, <strong>abece</strong>
      (pub.abece.my.id).
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>abece is an internal tool for scheduling and publishing content to social media accounts owned by abece
        (Anekdot and takardata). Only authorized members of the abece editorial team may use it.</li>
      <li>Each account is connected by its owner through the platform's official authorization screen (TikTok,
        Instagram, Facebook, Threads, YouTube) and can be disconnected at any time from the platform's settings.</li>
      <li>We only publish editorially approved content and follow each platform's community guidelines and developer
        terms.</li>
      <li>Content published by abece, Anekdot and takardata belongs to abece unless stated otherwise. Short quotes are
        welcome with attribution and a link to the original.</li>
      <li>Our content is general information, not professional advice. We correct errors openly.</li>
      <li>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of Indonesia. Contact:
        <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
